<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of English premier</p>
<p>league soccer matches played on Saturday:</p>
<p>Blackburn 0 Arsenal 2 (Wright 3rd and 51st minutes). Halftime</p>
<p>0-1. Attendance 24,303.</p>
<p>Derby 0 Newcastle 1 (Shearer 76th). 0-0. 18,092.</p>
<p>Everton 2 (Stuart 14th, Speed 78th) West Ham 1 (Dicks 86th,</p>
<p>penalty). 0-0. 36,571.</p>
<p>Leeds 2 (Wallace 46th and 90th) Nottingham Forest 0. 0-0.</p>
<p>29,225.</p>
<p>Leicester 1 (Watts 44th) Chelsea 3 (Vialli 48th, Di Matteo</p>
<p>64th, Hughes 80th). 1-0. 20,766.</p>
<p>Manchester United 1 (Beckham 23rd) Liverpool 0. 1-0. 55,128.</p>
<p>Tottenham 1 (Nielsen 61st) Aston Villa 0. 0-0. 32,847.</p>
<p>Wimbledon 4 (Ekoku 2nd, Earle 31st, Leonhardsen 67th, Jones</p>
<p>86th) Sheffield Wednesday 2 (Booth 3rd, Hyde 72nd). 2-1. 10,512.</p>
